{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04353","headline":"江南曲八首 一 · 刘希夷","name":"江南曲八首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮宿南洲草，晨行北岸林。\n日悬沧海阔，水隔洞庭深。\n烟景无留意，风波有异浔。\n岁游难极目，春戏易爲心。\n朝夕无荣遇，芳菲已满襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}